From a7d908c864bcf6cbd63ce7c1b0f5a77d9bee7371 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 01:36:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] fix(update-pause): a cooperative pause restarts the
 auto-continue freshness clock at paused_at

A live turn older than ~5 min could never be paused for a core update: not_resumable_reason applied the crash-recovery
freshness window to started_at, and freshness_since counted a plain pause from turn start. Now freshness_since counts a
core_update_pause marker from max(started_at, parked_at, paused_at), not_resumable_reason no longer rejects a live turn
on its age, and PAUSE_RESTARTS_FRESHNESS = True advertises it to hermes-sync. Crash recovery keeps started_at.
